{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiet in the Library</strong> is a point and click horror game about working the night shift in a library while danger lurks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new role as the night shift librarian! The job is simple: find all the books; manage your vitals; repair the machine when in breaks; don't let the intruder in. Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find all the Books</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106220/extras/712f18ceae2f68057ec2284a01635f85.poster.avif?t=1773908782\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106220/extras/712f18ceae2f68057ec2284a01635f85.webm?t=1773908782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106220/extras/712f18ceae2f68057ec2284a01635f85.mp4?t=1773908782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep the Intruder outside.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106220/extras/c70c412d9e9d67dd7859a745e6cc967e.avif?t=1773908782\" width=1440 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair broken equipment. Stay sane. Stay awake.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106220/extras/c259254ead8f636f2b1cdb0c90def964.avif?t=1773908782\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106220/extras_big/c259254ead8f636f2b1cdb